{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " θυ—μός, ὁ, soul, spirit, as the principle of life, feeling and thought, esp. of strong feeling and passion (rightly derived from θύω (B) by "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Cra. 419e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " ἀπὸ τῆς θύσεως καὶ ζέσεως τῆς ψυχῆς): in physical sense, breath, life, θ. ἀπηύρα, ἀφελέσθαι, ἐξαίνυσθαι, ὀλέσαι, freq. in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 6.17", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "5.852", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "155", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.205", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": c. dupl. acc., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄμφω θ. ἀπηύρα 6.17", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐπεί κε . . ῥεθέων ἐκ θ. ἕληται 22.68", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; λίπε δ' ὀστέα θ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "12.386", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀπὸ δ' ἔπτατο θ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 10.163", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὀλίγος δ' ἔτι θ. ἐνῆεν Il. 1.593", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μόγις δ' ἐσαγείρετο θυμόν 21.417", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄψορρόν οἱ θ. ἐνὶ στήθεσσιν ἀγέρθη 4.152", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θυμοῦ καὶ ψυχῆς κεκαδών 11.334", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; of animals, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "3.294", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "12.150", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: less freq. in Trag., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Ag. 1388", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Ba. 620", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "017", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (troch.). spirit, strength, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τείρετο δ' ἀνδρῶν θ. ὑπ' εἰρεσίης Od. 10.78", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐν δέ τε θ. τείρεθ' ὁμοῦ καμάτῳ τε καὶ ἱδρῷ Il. 17.744", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". πάτασσε δὲ θ. ἑκάστου each man's heart beat high, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "23.370", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "7.216", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". soul, as shown by the feelings and passions; and so, desire or inclination, esp. desire for meat and drink, appetite, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πιέειν ὅτε θ. ἀνώγοι Il. 4.263", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πλησάμενος . . θυμὸν ἐδητύος ἠδὲ ποτῆτος Od. 17.603", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": generally, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τά με θ. ἐνὶ στήθεσσι κελεύει Il. 7.68", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; βαλέειν δέ ἑ ἵετο θ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "8.301", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αἲ γάρ με μένος καὶ θ. ἀνείη 22.346", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; θ. ἐποτρύνῃ [τινά] "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 9.139", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; θ. ἐπέσσυταί τινι, ἐφορμᾶται, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 1.173", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "13.73", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἤθελε θυμῷ he wished in his heart or with all his heart, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "16.255", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "21.65", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἵετο θυμῷ 2.589", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; so later θυμῷ βουλόμενοι wishing with all their heart, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 5.49", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ["}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὄσσα v] οι θ. κε θέλῃ γένεσθαι Sapph. Supp. 1.3", "author_abbreviation": "Sapph.", "tlg_author": "0009", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θυμὸς ὥρμα Pi. O. 3.25", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "38", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θυμὸς ἡδονὴν φέρει S. El. 286", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὧν ἐρᾷ θυμός Herod. 7.61", "author_abbreviation": "Herod.", "tlg_author": "0650", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τῶν σφι θ. ἦν μάλιστα Hdt. 1.1", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄλλως σφι θ. ἐγένετο θεήσασθαι τὸν πόλεμον Id. 8.116", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: with Verb omitted, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σὲ γάρ μοι θῦμος ὔμνην Alc. 5", "author_abbreviation": "Alc.", "tlg_author": "0383", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἄρχ' αὐτὸς ὥς σοι θ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. El. 1319", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὅπου ὑμῖν θ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 3.1.37", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "βῆξαι θυμός ἐγγίνεται Hp. Prog. 8", "author_abbreviation": "Hp.", "tlg_author": "0627", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". mind, temper, will, θ. πρόφρων, ἵλαος, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 8.39", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "9.639", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; θ. ὑπερφίαλος καὶ ἀπηνής, νηλέα θ. ἔχοντας, σιδήρεος θ., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "15.94", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "19.229", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 5.191", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἕνα θ. ἔχειν to be of one mind, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 15.710", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐδὲ λύκοι τε καὶ ἄρνες ὁμόφρονα θ. ἔχουσιν 22.263", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἕτερος δέ με θ. ἔρυκε Od. 9.302", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐμὸν θ. ἔπειθεν ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "33", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θωπείας κολακικάς, αἳ . . τοὺς θ. ποιοῦσιν κηρίνους Pl. Lg. 633d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "034", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". spirit, courage, μένος καὶ θ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 20.174", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θ. ἐνὶ στήθεσσι λαβεῖν Od. 10.461", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; πᾶσιν δὲ παραὶ ποσὶ κάππεσε θ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 15.280", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ψῦχρος ἔγεντο θ., of doves, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Sapph. 16", "author_abbreviation": "Sapph.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θ. ἔχειν ἀγαθόν Hdt. 1.120", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "θ. οὐκ ἀπώλεσεν S. El. 26", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὁ θυμὸς εὐθὺς ἦν Ἀμυνίας Ar. Eq. 570", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἴωμεν ῥώμῃ καὶ θυμῷ ἐπί . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 4.2.21", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "